# Local-disk photo storage (dev default, PHOTO_STORAGE_PROVIDER=local) --
# user-uploaded content, never committed. The face-detection model asset in
# Backend/var/models/ IS committed (small, ~230KB, avoids a fragile
# download-at-first-run step for the team continuing this post-handoff).
# ArcFace recognition weights (~170MB) auto-download on first identity check.
Backend/var/models/w600k_r50.onnx
Backend/var/models/*.onnx.partial
Backend/var/photo_storage/